      "value": "Tested in open beta build 884. Interacting with the spawned objects appear to sync between all clients in the instance to the correct object. \nThis seems to be a weird test case as the provided prefab has an empty animator and data storage. @{5a0220ed7add6132ccf19b36|full_name} was the issue itself that these spawned objects would not send to the correct object simply if data storage was within the spawned object?",
